# Line endings.
#
# This repository is LF, everywhere, in the index and in working trees. Without
# this file nothing enforced that: an editor or tool on Windows could rewrite a
# file's endings as a side effect of a one-line change, and the resulting diff
# would show the whole file as modified, burying the real change. Ten tracked
# files had already drifted to CRLF or mixed endings before this was added.
#
# `eol=lf` (rather than plain `text=auto`) also pins the working-tree copy, so
# checking out on Windows does not reintroduce CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary formats: never normalize, never diff as text. `text=auto` detects most
# of these anyway, but being explicit means a corrupt byte in a fixture or an
# icon can never be "fixed" into corruption by normalization.
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.icns  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf   binary
*.eot   binary
*.zip   binary
*.node  binary
